WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:32.375
In the previous chapter, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:35.541
shed light on the subject of obtaining liberation

3
00:00:35.541 --> 00:00:38.750
and calmed Arjuna's curiosity.

4
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:41.125
Now in this verse of the eighth chapter,

5
00:00:41.125 --> 00:00:43.416
Arjuna's question to Lord Krishna is –

6
00:00:43.416 --> 00:00:44.625
how to remember Him

7
00:00:44.625 --> 00:00:47.125
at the time of death?

8
00:00:47.125 --> 00:00:50.125
And what is its result?

9
00:00:50.125 --> 00:00:53.125
Lord Krishna has given its answer in detail

10
00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:54.291
from verse 8.5

11
00:00:54.291 --> 00:00:58.041
to 8.8.

12
00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:04.708
In this verse, Lord Krishna

13
00:01:04.708 --> 00:01:06.000
sheds light on the importance

14
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.833
of remembrance done at the time of death.

15
00:01:08.833 --> 00:01:10.250
He clarifies that the

16
00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:12.125
person who leaves the body

17
00:01:12.125 --> 00:01:15.375
remembering only Him in their final moments

18
00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:16.041
immediately

19
00:01:16.041 --> 00:01:18.958
attains His divine nature.

20
00:01:18.958 --> 00:01:21.958
The moment of death is extremely important.

21
00:01:21.958 --> 00:01:23.208
In this moment, there's excessive

22
00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:26.166
instability and confusion.

23
00:01:26.166 --> 00:01:30.458
But keep in mind, if someone
 can remember Lord Krishna

24
00:01:30.458 --> 00:01:32.916
in this final moment,

25
00:01:32.916 --> 00:01:35.583
then becoming free from material bondages,

26
00:01:35.583 --> 00:01:39.291
they obtain Lord Krishna's eternal form.

27
00:01:39.291 --> 00:01:40.791
This verse teaches

28
00:01:40.791 --> 00:01:44.083
that maintaining deep attachment
 to Lord Krishna throughout life

29
00:01:44.083 --> 00:01:46.333
is extremely challenging.

30
00:01:46.333 --> 00:01:47.708
Remembering Lord Krishna

31
00:01:47.708 --> 00:01:50.375
isn't just mechanically worshipping Him,

32
00:01:50.375 --> 00:01:51.500
rather it's

33
00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:55.000
establishing Him in the heart
 with true devotional feeling.

34
00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.083
Lord Krishna gives assurance
 that one who in the final

35
00:01:58.083 --> 00:02:00.125
moment remembers Him,

36
00:02:00.125 --> 00:02:02.333
He takes them into His shelter.

37
00:02:02.333 --> 00:02:04.416
This result is certain –

38
00:02:04.416 --> 00:02:06.583
'There's no doubt in this.'

39
00:02:06.583 --> 00:02:08.125
In the verses ahead, Lord Krishna

40
00:02:08.125 --> 00:02:09.500
will make us understand

41
00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:10.708
how we from now

42
00:02:10.708 --> 00:02:13.583
keep increasing our love toward Him,

43
00:02:13.583 --> 00:02:15.375
so that in life's final moments

44
00:02:15.375 --> 00:02:20.250
we can naturally go into His shelter.

45
00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:27.916
Have you ever thought

46
00:02:27.916 --> 00:02:30.166
what your life's final

47
00:02:30.166 --> 00:02:33.916
moment will be like?

48
00:02:33.916 --> 00:02:35.125
Life's

49
00:02:35.125 --> 00:02:37.875
final moments are uncertain

50
00:02:37.875 --> 00:02:40.708
and challenging.

51
00:02:40.708 --> 00:02:44.833
How will you face these moments?

52
00:02:44.833 --> 00:02:47.958
This depends on

53
00:02:47.958 --> 00:02:50.750
how you

54
00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:53.666
lived your life.

55
00:02:53.666 --> 00:02:55.541
My words remind you of true

56
00:02:55.541 --> 00:02:59.166
remembrance's power.

57
00:02:59.166 --> 00:03:03.291
Just as when the sun sets,

58
00:03:03.291 --> 00:03:07.625
the entire sky becomes golden,

59
00:03:07.625 --> 00:03:09.500
similarly

60
00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.875
in final moments, My remembrance

61
00:03:12.875 --> 00:03:15.166
fills your life

62
00:03:15.166 --> 00:03:18.000
with divine light.

63
00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.666
Just mechanically

64
00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:23.166
chanting My name isn't enough.

65
00:03:23.166 --> 00:03:26.250
What's necessary is throughout life

66
00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:28.708
continuing to develop true faith

67
00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:32.416
and devotion toward Me.

68
00:03:32.416 --> 00:03:34.375
Look –

69
00:03:34.375 --> 00:03:38.000
when you talk with some loved one,

70
00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:42.625
are you mechanical or formal?

71
00:03:42.625 --> 00:03:47.000
No, you speak from the heart.

72
00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:51.875
Develop such a deep relationship with Me too.

73
00:03:51.875 --> 00:03:54.583
If you make devotion an essential rule

74
00:03:54.583 --> 00:03:58.458
of your daily routine,

75
00:03:58.458 --> 00:04:01.125
then even in the most difficult time,

76
00:04:01.125 --> 00:04:04.041
this devotion-filled remembrance will remain

77
00:04:04.041 --> 00:04:07.541
with natural feeling.

78
00:04:07.541 --> 00:04:09.250
Devotion done in mechanical manner

79
00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:13.583
doesn't create that deep relationship

80
00:04:13.583 --> 00:04:17.875
that you need in decisive moments.

81
00:04:17.875 --> 00:04:20.666
Just lighting the lamp of formality

82
00:04:20.666 --> 00:04:22.708
isn't enough,

83
00:04:22.708 --> 00:04:24.625
it also needs faith's oil

84
00:04:24.625 --> 00:04:27.416
and surrender's wick,

85
00:04:27.416 --> 00:04:31.583
only then will it give true light.

86
00:04:31.583 --> 00:04:35.833
Therefore, make your devotion true.

87
00:04:35.833 --> 00:04:38.125
Fill your heart with true love

88
00:04:38.125 --> 00:04:41.625
and My remembrance.

89
00:04:41.625 --> 00:04:43.750
Then in the final moment,

90
00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:48.166
you'll naturally come into My shelter

91
00:04:48.166 --> 00:04:49.750
and obtain that peace

92
00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:53.500
and eternal form,

93
00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:57.791
that the soul has always desired.

94
00:04:57.791 --> 00:05:00.958
Life's daily practice

95
00:05:00.958 --> 00:05:03.208
becomes supreme worship

96
00:05:03.208 --> 00:05:05.875
at the time of death.

97
00:05:10.875 --> 00:05:14.125
As family members

98
00:05:14.125 --> 00:05:17.625
move toward old age,

99
00:05:17.625 --> 00:05:19.458
it's our responsibility

100
00:05:19.458 --> 00:05:22.375
that we create such an environment

101
00:05:22.375 --> 00:05:25.833
through which they can

102
00:05:25.833 --> 00:05:29.000
remember Me with ease.

103
00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:32.166
Old age is that time when the body

104
00:05:32.166 --> 00:05:36.416
slowly starts getting tired and
 the mind can be surrounded

105
00:05:36.416 --> 00:05:40.666
by clouds of worries and regrets.

106
00:05:40.666 --> 00:05:45.041
In these moments, family's love and support

107
00:05:45.041 --> 00:05:51.333
plays an important role in
 making their mind's sky clear.

108
00:05:51.333 --> 00:05:52.916
You can create this

109
00:05:52.916 --> 00:05:56.833
spiritual environment in many ways.

110
00:05:56.833 --> 00:05:59.625
You can establish in the home regular prayer,

111
00:05:59.625 --> 00:06:02.750
chanting, spiritual discussion, or

112
00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:06.541
installation of My image.

113
00:06:06.541 --> 00:06:08.750
Think –

114
00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:11.500
have you ever seen

115
00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:15.541
what kind of sparkle comes in
 an elderly person's eyes?

116
00:06:15.541 --> 00:06:18.208
When the family sings spiritual

117
00:06:18.208 --> 00:06:21.291
songs, bhajans, etc., with them

118
00:06:21.291 --> 00:06:22.875
or discusses spiritual scriptures,

119
00:06:22.875 --> 00:06:27.000
literature, etc.

120
00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:28.250
These simple practices

121
00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:32.833
help in turning their mind away
 from the world's momentary troubles

122
00:06:32.833 --> 00:06:38.708
toward eternal peace.

123
00:06:38.708 --> 00:06:40.625
That peace which is obtained

124
00:06:40.625 --> 00:06:42.416
from connecting with Me.

125
00:06:42.416 --> 00:06:46.041
Your words, behavior, and home's atmosphere

126
00:06:46.041 --> 00:06:50.750
should be so steeped in love and devotion

127
00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:52.583
that it always reminds them

128
00:06:52.583 --> 00:06:55.500
of their spiritual journey.

129
00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:59.958
When the family unitedly creates
 such an environment,

130
00:06:59.958 --> 00:07:02.583
then such a family makes

131
00:07:02.583 --> 00:07:08.000
remembering Me very easy for the elderly.

132
00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:11.125
This service provides them
 wonderful peace and consolation

133
00:07:11.125 --> 00:07:15.083
in preparing for final moments.

134
00:07:15.083 --> 00:07:16.083
In this way,

135
00:07:16.083 --> 00:07:20.166
you offer them a priceless gift –

136
00:07:20.166 --> 00:07:24.125
by cooperating in their spiritual journey,

137
00:07:24.125 --> 00:07:26.333
by providing them opportunity

138
00:07:26.333 --> 00:07:30.833
to naturally come into My shelter.

139
00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:36.833
Like a skilled sailor

140
00:07:36.833 --> 00:07:41.291
who keeps their boat balanced

141
00:07:41.291 --> 00:07:43.041
even in storms.

142
00:07:43.041 --> 00:07:45.833
Are you able to maintain balance between 

143
00:07:45.833 --> 00:07:50.000
your professional life and inner peace?

144
00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:53.375
In your professional life, you become 

145
00:07:53.375 --> 00:07:55.708
so focused on work that

146
00:07:55.708 --> 00:07:57.125
you neglect other important

147
00:07:57.125 --> 00:08:02.000
aspects of life.

148
00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.416
But

149
00:08:03.416 --> 00:08:06.750
to ensure that in the final

150
00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:09.416
moment your mind can simply turn

151
00:08:09.416 --> 00:08:13.500
toward Me, you'll have to live a life of balance

152
00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:17.125
and principles.

153
00:08:17.125 --> 00:08:19.958
Free from remorse.

154
00:08:19.958 --> 00:08:22.041
If you spend your entire time

155
00:08:22.041 --> 00:08:23.541
only behind work field's

156
00:08:23.541 --> 00:08:26.000
success

157
00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:28.708
and neglect your relationships, responsibilities,

158
00:08:28.708 --> 00:08:32.666
or your spiritual peace,

159
00:08:32.666 --> 00:08:35.000
then when the final moment comes,

160
00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:39.833
focusing on Me will become difficult.

161
00:08:39.833 --> 00:08:41.666
Think,

162
00:08:41.666 --> 00:08:44.333
if the foundation itself isn't strong,

163
00:08:44.333 --> 00:08:46.708
then how will the building stand?

164
00:08:46.708 --> 00:08:50.125
Behave properly with people,

165
00:08:50.125 --> 00:08:51.833
be just,

166
00:08:51.833 --> 00:08:55.000
and fulfill all your responsibilities

167
00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.291
faithfully.

168
00:08:57.291 --> 00:09:01.541
In this way, you won't remain burdened

169
00:09:01.541 --> 00:09:06.625
by any guilt or weight of unresolved events.

170
00:09:06.625 --> 00:09:10.958
By living a balanced life, you
 prepare yourself to naturally

171
00:09:10.958 --> 00:09:14.583
turn toward Me.

172
00:09:14.583 --> 00:09:16.708
When you fulfill your duties

173
00:09:16.708 --> 00:09:20.583
and relationships well,

174
00:09:20.583 --> 00:09:23.416
then you free your heart from remorse

175
00:09:23.416 --> 00:09:26.958
and wanderings.

176
00:09:26.958 --> 00:09:31.250
All these actions make it simple
 for you to focus on Me

177
00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.083
in that final,

178
00:09:33.083 --> 00:09:37.375
decisive moment.

179
00:09:37.375 --> 00:09:38.875
Remember,

180
00:09:38.875 --> 00:09:43.375
life lived with integrity and balance is

181
00:09:43.375 --> 00:09:46.833
the key to supreme peace

182
00:09:46.833 --> 00:09:50.000
and obtaining Me in the end.
